---
description: Run engine and host composition; read the design docs first
globs: packages/core/**,packages/adapters-node/src/host/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Before changing run semantics or host composition, read the engine
  designs listed in `docs/designs/INDEX.md` (tag `engine`): DES-003
  lifecycle, DES-004 conditions and loops, DES-005 agents, DES-006
  sandboxing, DES-039 v2 architecture. Follow them.
- Append, then act. State is only a fold over the SQLite event log.
  Schemas live in `packages/contracts`. Domain rules live in
  `packages/core`; Node I/O and `createHost` live in
  `packages/adapters-node`.
- Pick work from `docs/backlogs/INDEX.md` and update the item's status.
- If the code needs to differ from a design, update that design doc and
  its `updated` date in the same change.
